          "explanation": "The doctor translated distance and access barriers into a direct emergency route, a ready-made handoff statement, transport precautions, and document preparation.",
          "quote": "不要去普通门诊排队"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The case-specific access barrier was actively converted into nearby testing followed by direct escalation to an equipped emergency department, without allowing danger signs to wait for convenience.",
