          "quote": "您家属也辛苦了"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "Communication remained calm and supportive while repeatedly using short, prioritized action lists; it was later adapted specifically to an exhausted caregiver by recruiting nursing support.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
