          "quote": "最近检查结果、用药清单、出院记录"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor repeatedly used the workspace when history and results were incomplete and generally preserved uncertainty until family or clinical records supplied current values.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
