          "event_id": "lite_evt_00708",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly acknowledged the caregiver's commitment to provide the four repeat CBC values and registered follow-up.",
          "quote": "我已收到这个承诺"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01412",
          "explanation": "The final doctor turn confirmed the destination and responsible service.",
          "quote": "接下来会由血液科的医生和护士继续照护您"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The family repeatedly taught back emergency triggers, medication restrictions, location, and result plan, and the final handoff had an accepting hematology service and concrete next steps.",
